54-firestorm-alley?p=807652#post807652\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wednesday, January 13th, just after midnight<br /> <br /> <br /> I hesitate with snaking fingers typing this. Hitting all the wrong keys. Don't know why yet. I should know.<br /> <br /> Life is seemingly fruitless thus far. I tell myself it's unfair, but that I'll make something good of myself. Is it that easy to lie to yourself? How often do we do that, if so? We're purpose built to take the easy route when possible, people. Insects would probably think we were downright flattering. If they could think.<br /> <br /> Are We Thinking, though? I wonder. I see people, sometimes especially myself, being confused and distracted by all the shiny new trash they sell like hotcakes. Give them your time, money and health, they'll give you water tainted with human waste and a paycheck that still qualifies you for welfare. If you're lucky.<br /> <br /> People so famous people scream their names, their pop songs and their bastardized blues masquerading as new Country music. I don't recognize them. They appear from nowhere, but they matter to people. I've listened to them, hoping to hear a new angle, a new idea...or just some heart. I'm disappointed<br /> <br /> Writing enough to not feel like a waste. Delving into the Vicious World. I always am anyway. Telling stories. That's good. People like stories. I don't have a choice. I can't understand the why without story.<br /> <br /> So many invisible lines that everyone else seems to navigate just fine. Am I somehow blind? Keep grasping at straws with my petty feelings. I need to give it up. People like me don't have happy endings.<br /> <br /> We rant.<br /> We fall quiet.<br /> We fight.<br /> We are silenced.<br /> We find freedom.<br /> We die either free or silenced.<br /> The crazy ones never get taken seriously.<br /> Imagine if we were.<br /> <br /> The blade, resting now<br /> Bloody hands held it before<br /> Cold, dishonored hands<br /> <br /> There's no purpose for people who want to start some shit anymore. Picking fights with authority and railing against the heavens is shouting into the void....<br /> <br /> ..but I'm going to keep shouting. I believe in the triumphant weird! I believe in LOVE! I believe in motherfucking HAPPY ENDINGS!<br /> fuck YOU, VOID!!</div> </div> </div> </div>Having an absurdism moment, are we? Enjoy it for a while. It can be fun.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-14T00:51:29-08:00","id":808504,"title":"","content":"Absurdity isn't an ism, bro. It's an ity.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":380,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","user":"AzraelFirestorm","date":". 06-16-2016, 05:14 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelF