t not giving a fuck, because I'm obviously awesome at that (please love me):<br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Yyx00sKtVrQ\" data-code=\"Yyx00sKtVrQ\" data-provider=\"youtube_share\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/Yyx00sKtVrQ/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-16T01:45:19-07:00","id":915465,"title":"","content":"People that leave me voicemails are good people, for the most part. They're just relaying a message. That's a vital function in society. <br /> I feel bad that, while I understand their struggle, they don't understand mine. I feel bad for them.<br /> I'm never going to return those calls. Nope. My bad, social protocol, but I ignore that function of my phone! <br /> Hooray for being less informed than I possibly could be!<br /> <br /> Trying to get out socially is another thing, though. I'm trying that. Meeting people, reuniting with old friends. It's great. It's something I'm enjoying. It's ...absolutely insane how many comedians are named Joey. I mean, for the love of fuck, I sent an email to a guy about booking named Joey, recommended to me by a dude named Joey, who was introduced to me by yet another entity wearing human skin named Joey. <br /> Is this some kind of cosmic joke, or did a meeting happen that I missed?<br /> <br /> I shaved my beard. It...wasn't even a beard. It was the neckbeard that sense of decency forgot. I can't grow facial hair to save my life. I have a wispy mustache, that I think I might only get away with due to either cultural normalcy or reverse racism. The rest looks like I shaved many crotches and then glued the results to my neck, like the worst Lincoln impersonator ever.<br /> <br /> I don't have a plan in life. I know where I'm heading, but in the larger scheme of things...just a big question mark. <br /> That's probably for the best. <br /> <br /> I had a plan the day I tried to solve my girlfriend's problem with weeds and set her backyard on fire.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":380,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","user":"AzraelFirestorm","date":". 06-16-2016, 06:25 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-16T02:26:08-07:00","id":915478,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Papa Bear</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Who are &quot;they&quot;?</div> </div> </div> </div>Star Whackers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":380,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","user":"AzraelFirestorm","date":". 06-16-2016, 06:18 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-17T03:03:17-07:00","id":916101,"title":"","content":"Sleep can be great sometimes. It can be painful and nightmare-inducing, as well. Life likes to stick with certain themes, I guess. <br /> I don't know that I want to sleep. I know I'm tired. I'm just not sure sleep is what's on the agenda for me. Thinking about the emotional reward of seeing people smile and laugh will be worth it, but between working and personal relationships, I've felt drained of essential energy<br /> I'm tired, but sleep isn't coming yet.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-17T03:23:59-07:00","id":916104,"title":"","content":"I'm thinking about the tour. I really didn't put much thought into the name Cute Little Roadkill, but I liked it enough to keep it and get it booked.<br /> Iowa is where I'm starting. It was a choice driven, in all honesty, by one enthusiast (I don't have fans) who wanted me to play his home state. That was enough for me. The reception from the close knit Iowa comedy scene is encouraging. I'm hoping we can wind our way through Nebraska, Colorado, Utah, Idaho and finally Oregon. That's the plan.<br /> <br /> The first show is a month+ off, but that's not a lot, really. I'm getting ready to be crazy and just live my dream. That's something I've surprised myself with. I'm taking a huge huge financial risk, but a big part of me refuses to be scared.<br /> Granted, I've been stressed out to the point of physical discomfort, but I can't care. I want to actively not give a fuck.<br /> Maybe I want that friction. Maybe I want the world to say they don't want what I'm bringing, just so I can prove them wrong.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-17T09:59:19-07:00","id":916287,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AzraelFirestorm</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/238954-firestorm-alley?p=916104#post916104\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Iowa is where I'm starting. It was a choice driven, in all honesty, by one enthusiast (I don't have fans) who wanted me to play his home state. That was enough for me. The reception from the close knit Iowa comedy scene is encouraging. I'm hoping we can wind our way through Nebraska, <b>Colorado</b>, Utah, Idaho and finally Oregon. That's the plan.</div> </div> </div> </div>Let me know when you get here. Have your lunch call my lunch and we'll do people.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-17T19:51:06-07:00","id":916570,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Papa Bear</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/238954-firestorm-alley?p=916287#post916287\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Let me know when you get here. Have your lunch call my lunch and we'll do people.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is Joey's lunch, Stacy! Hi! Joey's very busy right now preparing for the ridiculous things he does for attention.<br /> He wanted me to tell you personally that he takes your wordplay very seriously, and that he's seeing a therapist about it.<br /> <br /> -Stacy Mai Katpikchers,<br /> Personal Lunch","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":380,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","user":"AzraelFirestorm","date":". 06-17-2016, 10:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-20T02:52:55-07:00","id":917888,"title":"","content":"I love comedians. Being raised by a tv and a public library instilled in me a respect for the written and spoken word. Granted, my voice is terrible and I write like a drunken macaque, but let's ignore that for now. I want to move forward. Not just conversationally.<br /> <br /> I want some actual progress and not the crazy bullshit that I see daily on every screen. The world never made total sense to me, but I have to admit, teenage rebellious me couldn't hold a candle to how frustrated I get with life these days. That's like comparing a chihuahua to a werewolf.<br /> <br /> Comics, to me, are people who should live to speak their minds and lift spirits. You know that scene in the movie Fallen where Denzel Washington's character says &quot;Cops are the chosen people&quot;? It might seem narcissistic of me, but that's how I see comics, writers and artists. <br /> ...and then I see the compromises in personal values for shallow reasons, the breakdown of basic logic just for attention, the infighting..<br /> It makes my heart break, and it drains a little of my faith in the craft, and humanity. Just a little.<br /> <br /> We're supposed to make people laugh. Help a crowd have a good time. Hit your smile button.<br /> We're supposed to. And I'm not giving up for anything. I'll write jokes tomorrow, and the day after that, and the day af- you get the point. <br /> I'm exhausted.<br /> <br /> I came to write jokes and chew bubblegum, and I'm outta both tonight. I'll take out my comedy cartridge and blow on it in the morning. That always does the trick.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":380,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","user":"AzraelFirestorm","date":". 06-20-2016, 05:57 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-20T03:06:53-07:00","id":917893,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AzraelFirestorm</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/238954-firestorm-alley?p=917888#post917888\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I love comedians. Being raised by a tv and a public library instilled in me a respect for the written and spoken word. Granted, my voice is terrible and I write like a drunken macaque, but let's ignore that for now. I want to move forward. Not just conversationally.<br /> <br /> I want some actual progress and not the crazy bullshit that I see daily on every screen. The world never made total sense to me, but I have to admit, teenage rebellious me couldn't hold a candle to how frustrated I get with life these days. That's like comparing a chihuahua to a werewolf.<br /> <br /> Comics, to me, are people who should live to speak their minds and lift spirits. You know that scene in the movie Fallen where Denzel Washington's character says &quot;Cops are the chosen people&quot;? It might seem narcissistic of me, but that's how I see comics, writers and artists.<br /> ...and then I see the compromises in personal values for shallow reasons, the breakdown of basic logic just for attention, the infighting..<br /> It makes my heart break, and it drains a little of my faith in the craft, and humanity. Just a little.<br /> <br /> We're supposed to make people laugh. Help a crowd have a good time. Hit your smile button.<br /> We're supposed to. And I'm not giving up for anything. I'll write jokes tomorrow, and the day after that, and the day af- you get the point.<br /> I'm exhausted.<br /> <br /> I came to write jokes and chew bubblegum, and I'm outta both tonight. I'll take out my comedy cartridge and blow on it in the morning. That always does the trick.</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"http://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Theatre/Pagliacci\" target=\"_blank\">Ridi, pagliaccio, ridi.</a> /Hug","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":175,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","user":"Prometheus878","date":". 06-20-2016, 06:09 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-20T06:16:21-07:00","id":917982,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prometheus878</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/238954-firestorm-alley?p=917893#post917893\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <a href=\"https://&amp;quot;&#91;url\" target=\"_blank\">http://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Theatre/Pagliacci&amp;quot;]Ridi</a>, pagliaccio, ridi.[/URL] /Hug</div> </div> </div> </div>*hug*<br /> <br /> Does this mean we're finally going to the opera together?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-20T16:40:17-07:00","id":918306,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AzraelFirestorm</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/238954-firestorm-alley?p=917982#post917982\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> *hug*<br /> <br /> Does this mean we're finally going to the opera together?</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe, but not